re stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":288272,"global_rank":27724},{"name":"StevenUS/dotfiles","owner":"StevenUS","html_url":"https://github.com/StevenUS/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288262,"global_rank":27731},{"name":"zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","owner":"zaro0508","html_url":"https://github.com/zaro0508/sceptre-identity-resolver","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"A set of Sceptre resolvers to help identify a stack","topics":[],"score":288259,"global_rank":27734},{"name":"maddendeavor/automation-tools","owner":"maddendeavor","html_url":"https://github.com/maddendeavor/automation-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":3,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288253,"global_rank":27737},{"name":"renysaldivar/Charms","owner":"renysaldivar","html_url":"https://github.com/renysaldivar/Charms","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":288248,"global_rank":27740},{"name":"bebeal/VizDoomGym","owner":"bebeal","html_url":"https://github.com/bebeal/VizDoomGym","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Highly Customizable Gym interface for ViZDoom.","topics":[],"score":288246,"global_rank":27742},{"name":"patorrad/OmniIsaacGymUR16eEnv","owner":"patorrad","html_url":"https://github.com/patorrad/OmniIsaacGymUR16eEnv","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":